                    <h3 class="h3">Subscription model perfect for scaling up</h3>
                    <div class="text-16-150 opacity-80">Startups and growing teams often struggle with re-explaining their brand to every new freelancer. TaskNet didn’t have to. Our subscription model gave them direct access to our team, making it easy to scale creative work without starting from scratch each time.</div>
